(text "Active-low to GND, internal pull-ups (no resistors).\nAll on RTC GPIOs: any button can wake from deep sleep (ext1)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 22.86 184.15 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "c934dc08-4aaf-58a6-8e2c-6b8e8ea0e562"))
(rectangle (start 165.1 147.32) (end 403.86 196.85) (stroke (width 0.2) (type dash) (color 120 120 120 1)) (fill (type none)) (uuid "85b13cd8-7c2e-5231-9801-f51e54aac986"))
(text "NOTES" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 167.64 149.86 0) (effects (font (size 2.0 2.0) (bold yes)) (justify left top)) (uuid "5c79cd6b-988f-54e1-b763-59b89ded49ed"))
(text "Parts not in the kit: SW1 slide switch, SW2–SW4 tactile buttons, R1/R2 100k, C1 100nF.\n\n1.  Never power the board from the DevKit USB while SW1 is ON. Espressif lists USB, the 5V pin and the 3V3 pin\n     as mutually exclusive supplies, and here TPS63020 drives 3V3 directly. Switch off before flashing.\n2.  TP4056: use the 6-pad version with DW01 protection. System ground is OUT−. Charge through its own USB port;\n     the device can run while charging (OUT+ follows the charger).\n3.  microSD module: if it carries an AMS1117 regulator it expects 5 V. At 3.3 V either buy a 3.3 V-direct module\n     or bridge the regulator IN to OUT.\n4.  Left unconnected on purpose: IO35–37 (octal PSRAM on N16R8), IO0/IO3/IO45/IO46 (strapping),\n     IO19/IO20 (native USB), IO43/IO44 (UART0 console), IO38 (on-board RGB LED).\n5.  Display and microSD share SPI2: SCK IO12, MOSI IO11, MISO IO13. Separate chip selects IO10 / IO14.\n     Keep the SD on its own CS and deselect both before init.\n6.  Battery: 1S LiPo, 3.0–4.2 V. TPS63020 runs from 1.8–5.5 V, so the 3.3 V rail holds\n     all the way down to cut-off." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 170.18 156.21 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "dcfa3c43-3e07-5c64-bce4-e941ce847b5b"))
(text "GPIO MAP" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 350.52 156.21 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27) (bold yes)) (justify left top)) (uuid "9a341f2a-e28d-5033-b3d7-60d696ed1602"))
(text "SPI_SCK\nSPI_MOSI\nSPI_MISO\nEPD_CS\nEPD_DC\nEPD_RST\nEPD_BUSY\nSD_CS\nBTN_PREV\nBTN_NEXT\nBTN_MENU\nVBAT_SENSE" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 350.52 160.02 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "968ee8ab-1ffb-5382-a312-b4448670a1e4"))
